---
description: Falkevin Interior Designers interior design site rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind. No new dependencies without a strong reason.
- Never hard-code client content (names, phone, copy, image URLs) in components; read from /content.
- All colors and fonts come from theme CSS variables.
- All images via next/image with alt text, defined only in content/images.ts. Never use Google Images or unlicensed photos.
- Animations: slow, subtle, reduced-motion aware. No bounce, spin, particles, cursor effects.
- Design tone: warm, quiet, editorial, architectural. Restraint over decoration.
- Mobile-first; verify 360/390/768/1024/1440 widths.
- Run `npm run build` and fix all errors before finishing a phase.
